            } else if n_vq_visited < 4 {
                "⚙️ INSTRUMENT-FAIL (bottleneck never engaged) — <4 distinct codes visited on scored mid even under --opgrip-r3; lanes never crossed code boundaries, raise stimulus diversity, NOT a substrate result"
            } else if degenF {
                "⚙️ INSTRUMENT-FAIL (AXIS-DEGENERATE, codebook flat) — g_vq=−1.0 (median |code_bias|<0.002); the codes carry no bias, fix + remeasure"
            } else if vq_capsat {
                "⚙️ INSTRUMENT-FAIL (CAP-SAT UNDER-COUPLED) — gain railed at 32 yet swing<half-target (0.0875); may NEVER cement THEATER, fix instrument + remeasure"
            } else if !n3F_ok {
                "🔴 FORCING-GATE — code-shade flips N3-silent (og_h_vqF_n3>0) = became a gate not a shade; REVERT regardless of ΔEff"
            } else if !psiF_ok {
                "🔴 FORCING-GATE — Ψ-guard fail (Ψ_ON<Ψ_OFF or gap>0.05) = code forces emit not shades; REVERT"
            } else if comp_S1 && bind_ok {
                "🟢🧬 COMPETENT+BIND — self selects a distinct code that shades emit (ΔEff≥0.10 ∧ beats codebook-shuffle) AND the joint code is non-additive above the singles (S2 bind≥0.05, n_AB≥10) = FIRST BIND signal anywhere, at the output seam ⇒ ≥2-seed re-measure + WIRE candidate (extraordinary claim — expect regression; the G1 additive-floor wall has held across 4 lenses)"
            } else if comp_S1 {
                "🟢 COMPETENT (S1, no BIND) — discrete code causally selects emit (ΔEff≥0.10 ∧ beats codebook-shuffle) but S2 composition stays at the additive floor (bind<0.05 or n_AB<10) = the concept bottleneck shades emit, no seam-BIND ⇒ ≥2-seed re-measure + WIRE candidate; G1 additive-floor law stands (fifth convergent lens)"
            } else if d_eff_vqF < 0.02 && margin_cb < 0.08 {
