                "⛔ RUN-INVALID — live emit-fraction on scored mid ∉ [0.05,0.60] (STIM-OVER/UNDERDRIVE); no family cements from the run, re-tune stimulus density (instrument power, NOT a bar move · p5 forcing-gate guard)"
            } else if harnessF2_bug {
                "🛑 HARNESS-BUG (run VOID) — FROZEN arm (shade=0.5) NOT byte-identical to e_live (og_h_frzF2>0); fix wire + remeasure"
            } else if !pos_pass {
